WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.017 --> 00:00:08.552
Open Notifications in More, then Pending Reminders

2
00:00:08.552 --> 00:00:12.091
Tap plus and choose a time

3
00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:21.064
Choose the days, then save

4
00:00:21.064 --> 00:00:28.341
Turn it on. You're notified of the count only when entries are pending

5
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:37.067
In Wallets, choose which wallets to count
